id:e0df2267-a6cc-4736-b9be-a8d743c0154c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e0df2267-a6cc-4736-b9be-a8d743c0154c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;281&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;496</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The book is a clear work in progress though already extensive, chronicling various musical styles and notation from across <a href=\"/wiki/Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Faerûn\">Faerûn</a>. Amid the orderly symbols and blackened ink, one page stands out. It is awash in colour and meandering arcs. The script below reads:]\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Myconid\" title=\"Myconid\">Myconid</a> Song\n</p><p><br>\nBy <a href=\"/wiki/Oghma\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oghma\">Oghma</a>, I hear it AND I see it AND I know it AND I feel it. But I can't write it. Or can I?\n</p>\n</div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Faer%C3%BBn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Faerûn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"